<Base title="Affiliate Disclosure | The Soft Nest Edit" description="How Amazon affiliate links support The Soft Nest Edit and how we develop editorial product recommendations.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="shell"><span class="eyebrow">TRANSPARENCY MATTERS</span><h1>Affiliate <em>disclosure.</em></h1><p>Here's how shopping links and editorial recommendations work on our website.</p></div></section>
  <div class="shell info-page"><div class="manifesto"><p><strong>As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases.</strong></p></div><p>The Soft Nest Edit participates in the Amazon Associates program. When you click a clearly labeled affiliate link and make a qualifying purchase, we may receive a commission at no additional cost to you.</p><p>Products featured in our Shop and linked from our Journal may contain affiliate links. We label those links and also provide notices near relevant shopping recommendations.</p><h2>Our editorial approach</h2><p>We aim to provide original context about why an item might suit a certain space and the details worth checking. Unless we clearly state otherwise, a recommendation is based on editorial research rather than personal hands-on testing. We do not republish Amazon customer ratings as our own.</p><h2>Pricing, shipping and returns</h2><p>Amazon controls product prices, inventory, listing details, shipping policies, and the customer checkout process. Verify those details on Amazon before buying. We do not process orders or payment information on this site.</p><h2>Questions?</h2><p>Visit our <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a> for current contact options.</p></div>
</Base>
